<title>USA: Kansas City Southern Industries Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Southern Industries Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.87		    $4.11</p>
<p> Net			 32,500		  171,900</p>
<p> Revs		     220,900		  198,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,300		   41,900</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding $144.6 million after-tax gain related to the DST Systems Inc stock offering in November 1995, fourth quarter earnings were $0.87 a share in 1996 versus $0.66 a share in 1995.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.92		    $5.41</p>
<p> Net			150,900		  236,700</p>
<p> Revs		     847,300		  775,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,400		   43,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Exclusive of non-recurring gains related to DST in both years and 1995 unusual costs and expenses, 1996 earnings were $2.68 a share versus $2.10 a share in 1995.</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Kansas City Southern Industries Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
